when I'm playing Bingo.

00:17:23.175 --> 00:17:24.343 line:92%
You know what I'm saying?

00:17:24.343 --> 00:17:25.711 align:start size:94% position:6%
Everyone is excited
about the news,

00:17:25.711 --> 00:17:28.480 align:start size:94% position:6%
while the adults who secretl
got braces are like,

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:32.751 line:92%
