00:17:52.738 --> 00:17:54.907 line:92%
Tariq, you know what this means.

00:17:54.907 --> 00:18:02.548 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:18:02.548 --> 00:18:05.084 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Crunch! ]

00:18:06.785 --> 00:18:12.224 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Slow...motion...acting.

00:18:12.224 --> 00:18:13.158 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Good work, Tariq.

00:18:13.158 --> 00:18:13.792 size:88% position:44% line:92%
As if getting vaccinated

