00:18:20.666 --> 00:18:21.266 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Listen to this.

00:18:21.266 --> 00:18:23.268 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Governor Mike DeWine
is implementing

00:18:23.268 --> 00:18:26.638 align:start size:94% position:6%
