00:18:44.423 --> 00:18:46.225 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I don't know."

00:18:46.225 --> 00:18:47.793 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, a million-dollar
vaccine lottery.

00:18:47.793 --> 00:18:50.195
