00:18:52.598 --> 00:18:55.000 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, really?
-Yeah. It's a theme thing.

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:55.667 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Wow!

00:18:55.667 --> 00:18:56.935 align:start size:94% position:6%
