-Ugh!

00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:30.068 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Wait.

00:19:30.068 --> 00:19:31.703 align:start size:94% position:6%
Wait.
-Oh, my God.

00:19:31.703 --> 00:19:33.238 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wait a minute.
-Oh! Oh!

00:19:33.238 --> 00:19:35.807
-The sound you just heard
was every New Yorker pukin

00:19:35.807 --> 00:19:39.111 line:92%
