00:19:39.111 --> 00:19:40.245 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my God.
-Wait.

00:19:40.245 --> 00:19:41.613 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Somehow, that was real.

00:19:41.613 --> 00:19:43.048 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That was real?
-Yeah, it happened today.

00:19:43.048 --> 00:19:45.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
