00:19:46.752 --> 00:19:48.487 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Both: No.
-No, that happened.

00:19:48.487 --> 00:19:49.955 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That was real. That happened.
-Yeah.

00:19:49.955 --> 00:19:52.891 align:start size:94% position:6%
Somehow, de Blasio
did the impossible.

00:19:52.891 --> 00:19:55.928 align:start size:94% position:6%
