your phone upside down?

00:24:01.807 --> 00:24:03.175 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We can't see you.
-This way?

00:24:03.175 --> 00:24:06.211 align:start size:94% position:6%
-One more. One more click.
-One more.

00:24:06.211 --> 00:24:06.845 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
One more.

00:24:06.845 --> 00:24:08.146 align:start size:94% position:6%
-One more.
-One more.

00:24:08.146 --> 00:24:09.214 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-One more.

00:24:09.214 --> 00:24:10.048 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah!

00:24:10.048 --> 00:24:13.151 align:start size:94% position:6%
