00:25:30.128 --> 00:25:31.196 size:75% position:38% line:92%
and had to say this.

00:25:31.196 --> 00:25:33.465 line:92%
-We will rebuild our economy

00:25:33.465 --> 00:25:37.536 align:start size:94% position:6%
reclaim our lives,
and get back to normal.

00:25:37.536 --> 00:25:40.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
We'll laugh again,
we'll know joy again,

00:25:40.672 --> 00:25:42.274 size:81% position:41% line:92%
and we'll smile again.

00:25:42.274 --> 00:25:44.309 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:25:44.309 --> 00:25:46.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I got to be honest --
it's nice having a president

00:25:46.278 --> 00:25:48.413 align:start size:94% position:6%
who speaks
in Pottery Barn signs.

00:25:48.413 --> 00:25:51.383 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:25:51.383 --> 00:25:52.450 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Isn't that nice?

00:25:52.450 --> 00:25:55.120 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:25:55.120 --> 00:25:57.822 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ As Biden ]
We'll eat, pray, love.

00:25:57.822 --> 00:25:58.823 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:25:58.823 --> 00:26:02.060
Biden then laid out the ne
rules for wearing a mask

00:26:02.060 --> 00:26:04.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
very simply.
Take a look.

00:26:04.129 --> 00:26:07.232 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-It's...

00:26:07.232 --> 00:26:08.333 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-That's it.

00:26:08.333 --> 00:26:09.234 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:26:09.234 --> 00:26:10.502 line:92%
Perfect clip right there.

00:26:10.502 --> 00:26:13.738
Biden just officially became
our first TikTok president

00:26:13.738 --> 00:26:16.374 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:26:16.374 --> 00:26:18.843 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Cheering ]

00:26:18.843 --> 00:26:20.645 align:start size:94% position:6%
Meanwhile,
with the new CDC guidance,

00:26:20.645 --> 00:26:23.648 align:start size:94% position:6%
some businesses have dropped
their mask policies,

00:26:23.648 --> 00:26:25.417 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I saw that others,
like Walmart,

00:26:25.417 --> 00:26:26.751 line:92%
are still requiring them.

00:26:26.751 --> 00:26:29.321 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yep, as of now,
Walmart still requires a mask,

00:26:29.321 --> 00:26:31.523 align:start size:94% position:6%
but, somehow,
it doesn't require pants.

00:26:31.523 --> 00:26:33.291 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:26:33.291 --> 00:26:34.359 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Let's switch gears here.

00:26:34.359 --> 00:26:35.327 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I saw that researchers

00:26:35.327 --> 00:26:36.261 line:92%
at the University of Arizona

00:26:36.261 --> 00:26:40.231 size:84% position:42%
have developed a cure
for bad breath in dogs.

00:26:40.231 --> 00:26:43.668
I just feel bad for the on
scientist who was like --

00:26:43.668 --> 00:26:44.736 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Sniff ]

00:26:44.736 --> 00:26:46.304 align:start size:94% position:6%
Nope.
Let's keep trying.

00:26:46.304 --> 00:26:47.505 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:26:47.505 --> 00:26:49.841 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's right,
pet owners were really excited

00:26:49.841 --> 00:26:50.675 line:92%
while everyone else was like

00:26:50.675 --> 00:26:52.544 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Is this really the cure
we needed right now?

00:26:52.544 --> 00:26:55.880 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
That's what you're working on?

00:26:55.880 --> 00:26:58.750
That's right,
the cure can eliminate the smell

00:26:58.750 --> 00:27:00.785 size:75% position:38% line:92%
for about two hours.

00:27:00.785 --> 00:27:03.421 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
I wouldn't call that a cure.

00:27:03.421 --> 00:27:04.689 size:88% position:44% line:92%
I'd call that an Altoid.

00:27:04.689 --> 00:27:06.191 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:27:06.191 --> 00:27:07.292 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, finally,
this is very exciting --

00:27:07.292 --> 00:27:10.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
an all-glass-enclosed elevator
that travels more

00:27:10.362 --> 00:27:12.364 line:92%
than 1,200 feet in the air

00:27:12.364 --> 00:27:14.432 align:start size:94% position:6%
is opening this fall
in New York City.

00:27:14.432 --> 00:27:16.134 line:92%
Take a look at this thing.

00:27:16.134 --> 00:27:17.569 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Whoas ]

00:27:17.569 --> 00:27:19.504
Yep.
They don't charge you to get on,

00:27:19.504 --> 00:27:20.772 align:start size:94% position:6%
but they do charge you
to get off.

00:27:20.772 --> 00:27:22.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
"Get me out of here!"

00:27:22.707 --> 00:27:24.909 size:88% position:44%
Seriously, that thing's
about to kill more birds

00:27:24.909 --> 00:27:26.077 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
than Captain Sully.

00:27:26.077 --> 00:27:27.979 line:92%
[ Laughter and grumbling ]

00:27:27.979 --> 00:27:30.715 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Isolated clapping ]
Just to mess with people,

00:27:30.715 --> 00:27:33.051 align:start size:94% position:6%
every now and then,
they play this sound effect --

00:27:33.051 --> 00:27:34.519 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Glass breaks ]

